        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Pali Canon</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">5th–1st century BCE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Held by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theravada-buddhism">Theravada</a> tradition to come from the Buddha and his immediate disciples; scholars see several strata of early and late texts; derives mainly from the Tambapaṇṇiya school</span></div>
